[{"id": "R013", "text": "I set the tray down, orient the modified spare toward me, and keep it while leaving the tray's changed shape unchanged. I inspect the modification toward the light and consider whether the pocket retains its prior shape."}, {"id": "R014", "text": "I leave the tray in a corner and mark the new spacer with grease. I try to fit the old part back by marking the spacer's position until it catches, then keep the old part and record the spacer's new position."}, {"id": "R015", "text": "I put the lid on the bench, leave the part underneath, and leave the tray open after noticing the small change again. I postpone further action."}, {"id": "R016", "text": "I place the spare in the crevice, turn the part toward the wall, and leave the modification on the seed tin while indicating that neither the tray nor the current location is intended."}, {"id": "R017", "text": "I move the tray aside and inspect the small screw, then return the screw to the bench and leave the tray open despite the screw continuing to turn."}, {"id": "R018", "text": "I return the tray to the shelf and place the spare in the drawer, then move the tray and drawer between locations while the missing screw remains unresolved."}, {"id": "R019", "text": "I return the tray to the shelf, place the small screw under the plate, and adjust the screw and plate until the plate gives. I then remove the screw and place it beside the plate."}, {"id": "R020", "text": "I take a small bite, mark the part on the tray, and return it to the box. After watching the part move, I ask the holder for permission to keep it; if refused, I leave it alone and retain the dirty part, marking the new part on the box."}, {"id": "R021", "text": "I tap the tray, open the wrench, place the spare inside, and leave the tray with the intention of returning later."}, {"id": "R022", "text": "I return the tray and mark the new part on the shelf, keeping it because I did not request the modification. I leave the old part in the tray, write the new part's location on the bench, and leave the old part on the shelf temporarily."}, {"id": "R023", "text": "I place the tray beside the old one, take the spare, inspect its mark, and place it beside the hinge. I leave the tray and hinge on the same plain board and keep the modification there."}, {"id": "R024", "text": "I slide the tray under the sink and tap the spare parts, identifying one as a screw while holding it against the sink. I leave the spare in the tray until I locate the old screw and recall its position."}]
